<title>SWITZERLAND: CURLING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CURLING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE, Switzerland 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results from the world curling championships on Friday:</p>
<p>Women:</p>
<p> Canada beat Denmark    5-2</p>
<p> Norway beat Japan     12-5</p>
<p>Men:</p>
<p> Sweden beat Canada     6-4</p>
<p>Germany beat Scotland  6-3</p>
</text>
